{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:19 2026-10-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:19 2026-10-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:19 2026-10-14 HKT</p><p>一股偏東氣流正影響廣東東部沿岸。</p><p>本港地區今日漸轉多雲。初時有一兩陣微雨，部分地區能見度較低。日間最高氣溫約31度。吹微風，漸轉吹和緩東風，離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><img alt=\"初時有一兩陣微雨，部分地區能見度較低。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25c3f8e15200e586adc0ef1e2b81d5e0/2026-10/1_1_17.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5aa711d4f181040be1889d075e2638d/2026-10/2026-10-13_23_58_37.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6aefda654178cc98ce1f215540627581/2026-10/2026-10-13_23_58_47.png\"/><img alt=\"初時有一兩陣微雨，部分地區能見度較低。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a4303fb86d403afa5a38c6caadb5fb1/2026-10/3_3_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"初時有一兩陣微雨，部分地區能見度較低。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/578f6d993e226ec09394f3598a04b4a4/2026-10/4_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"初時有一兩陣微雨，部分地區能見度較低。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18c1634647119786acdee2f6adce5969/2026-10/5_1_9.jpeg\"/><p>展望未來兩三日雲量較多，早晚有一兩陣微雨，日間短暫時間有陽光。重陽節及翌日日間天色良好及乾燥。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:03.702817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T23:19:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:11.601158+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:11.601158+00:00","content_hash":"6a20c3cc70c272f6c3c1ad76ac286ff12501948cc7319f7cb52aa819c605073e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}